{"song_id": 7096173, "title": "Medley", "language": "fr", "lyricists": [55334], "lyrics": [{"section_id": "section_0", "type": "intro", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "- \"Bizarre...\"", "rhyme": "aR", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "- \"Tu voulais me voir Lisa ?\" (Stupeflip)", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "- \"Oui, j'ai \u00e0 te parler de quelque chose...\"", "rhyme": "oz", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "3", "text": "- \"Tu sais bien que tu peux tout dire \u00e0 ton confident. Que se passe-t-il ?\"", "rhyme": "il", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "4", "text": "- \"C'est au sujet de [Logan].\"", "rhyme": "#", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "5", "text": "- \"[Logan] ? Je ne comprends pas. Et qu'est-ce qu'il a fait ce [Logan] ?\"", "rhyme": "#", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "6", "text": "- \"Il n'a rien fait...\" (ha)", "rhyme": "E", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "7", "text": "\"J'ai une impression curieuse... je ne sais pas pourquoi j'ai mal dans la gorge quand nous sommes ensemble... ni pourquoi j'ai des frissons quand nos mains se touchent.\"", "rhyme": "uS", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "8", "text": "- \"Mal de gorge ? Frissons ? Toi tu nous couves un rhume.\"", "rhyme": "ym", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "9", "text": "- \"Mais je n'couves rien du tout. Et tu n'entends rien \u00e0 rien ! Tu n'es qu'une machine idiote et je ne sais pas pourquoi je discute avec toi !\"", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}], "rhyme": "ABCDEEFGHB", "rhyme_vowel": "AABCDDEFGA"}, {"section_id": "section_1", "type": "couplet", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Yah !", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Stupeflip", "rhyme": "ip", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Crou Crou", "rhyme": "u", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Ah !", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "4", "text": "Je suis assis dans un caf\u00e9, j'attends le caf\u00e9", "rhyme": "e", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "5", "text": "Parce que sans lui j'peux pas \u00e9crire ce texte et la combinaison caf\u00e9-clope", "rhyme": "Op", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "6", "text": "C'est super", "rhyme": "ER", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "7", "text": "J'aurais pas d\u00fb prendre ce sandwich saucisson", "rhyme": "$", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "8", "text": "Le pain est trop dur et j'avais d'mand\u00e9 des cornichons, pas grave", "rhyme": "av", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "9", "text": "Je vois les gens et c'est plus science-fiction que la Guerre des \u00c9toiles", "rhyme": "al", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "10", "text": "\u00c0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 d'moi y'a un pigeon", "rhyme": "$", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "11", "text": "Je m'demande co- s- co- -orps comment tient sur ses petites pattes si fines", "rhyme": "in", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "12", "text": "Mais finalement j'm'en fous", "rhyme": "u", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "13", "text": "Tout est tellement dingue que j'cherche m\u00eame p'us \u00e0 comprendre", "rhyme": "#dR", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "14", "text": "La g\u00e9n\u00e9ration des p'tites meufs", "rhyme": "9f", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "15", "text": "Elles sont toutes si fines, elles ont toutes des p'tites bottes courtes", "rhyme": "uRt", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "16", "text": "Et leur mec c'est un peu moi", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "17", "text": "Car ils ont les m\u00eames fringues que moi, genre des blousons Zara", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "18", "text": "Pa'ce-que j'y passe mon temps \u00e0 Zara, place d'It' depuis la fin d'Stupeflip", "rhyme": "ip", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "19", "text": "Tu sais, ces p'tits blousons pr\u00e8s du corps", "rhyme": "OR", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "20", "text": "J'ai pass\u00e9 toute ma vie \u00e0 les chercher et maintenant n'importe quel connard l'a", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "21", "text": "Alors que dans les ann\u00e9es a- quatre-vingt-dix, ils avaient que des gros blousons d'merde", "rhyme": "ERd", "persona_id": "kingju"}], "rhyme": "ABCADEFGHIGJCKLMAABNAO", "rhyme_vowel": "ABCADEFGAAGBCHICAABEAF"}, {"section_id": "section_2", "type": "couplet", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Yaaaah !", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Ce morceau s'adresse \u00e0 tous les tristes sirs l\u00e2ches et racistes", "rhyme": "ist", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Planqu\u00e9s derri\u00e8re leur ordi", "rhyme": "i", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Houss !", "rhyme": "os", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "4", "text": "Ils sont comme des serpents, ils pissent sur mes sentiments", "rhyme": "#", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "5", "text": "Incroyables cons et dans mon cou ils plantent leurs dents", "rhyme": "#", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "6", "text": "De quoi d'venir parano\u00efde", "rhyme": "id", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "7", "text": "Pauv' nazes, z'ont la haine, font chier, bourr\u00e9s sous st\u00e9ro\u00efdes", "rhyme": "id", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "8", "text": "Arrogants", "rhyme": "#", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "9", "text": "I's s'la jouent testost\u00e9rone", "rhyme": "On", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "10", "text": "Va falloir l\u00e2cher l'affaire", "rhyme": "ER", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "11", "text": "Ha ! Ha !", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "12", "text": "Ils sont jaloux", "rhyme": "u", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "13", "text": "Ils observent leur voisin", "rhyme": ")", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "14", "text": "Z'ont pas envie d'le voir heureux, cette seule vision les rend zinzins", "rhyme": ")", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "15", "text": "\u00c7a les renvoie \u00e0 leur triste r\u00e9alit\u00e9", "rhyme": "e", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "16", "text": "Vie d'merde, taff de merde, du cervelas dans l'cervelet", "rhyme": "E", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "17", "text": "Z'ont du Flanby dans l'slop", "rhyme": "Op", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "18", "text": "Bande de salopes", "rhyme": "Op", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "19", "text": "Faut qu'i's restent tranquille ou j'les d\u00e9coupe", "rhyme": "up", "persona_id": "kingju"}], "rhyme": "ABCDEEFFEGHAIJJKLMMN", "rhyme_vowel": "ABBCDDBBDEFAGHHIFEEG"}, {"section_id": "section_3", "type": "outro", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Stupeflip c'est pas n'importe quoi", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "\u00c7a fout l'feu", "rhyme": "2", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "\u00c7a t'handicape quand tu l'as pas", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "3", "text": "C't'une construction math\u00e9matique", "rhyme": "ik", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "4", "text": "Un truc pataphysique qui t'pique comme un aspic", "rhyme": "ik", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "5", "text": "Stupeflip c'est pas n'importe quoi", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "6", "text": "\u00c7a fout l'feu", "rhyme": "2", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "7", "text": "\u00c7a t'handicape quand tu l'as pas", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "8", "text": "C't'une construction math\u00e9matique", "rhyme": "ik", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "9", "text": "Un truc pataphysique qui t'pique comme un aspic", "rhyme": "ik", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "10", "text": "Stupeflip c'est pas n'importe quoi", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "11", "text": "\u00c7a fout l'feu", "rhyme": "2", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "12", "text": "\u00c7a t'handicape quand tu l'as pas", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "13", "text": "C't'une construction math\u00e9matique", "rhyme": "ik", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "14", "text": "Un truc pataphysique qui t'pique comme un aspic", "rhyme": "ik", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "15", "text": "Stupeflip c'est pas n'importe quoi", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "16"